## Status — badges / sync chips

```elixir
stage.(css, """
<span class="matome-badge matome-badge--work"><span class="matome-badge__dot"></span><span>Work</span></span>
<span class="matome-badge matome-badge--personal"><span class="matome-badge__dot"></span><span>Personal</span></span>
<span class="matome-badge matome-badge--ideas"><span class="matome-badge__dot"></span><span>Ideas</span></span>
<span class="matome-badge matome-badge--default"><span class="matome-badge__dot"></span><span>Default</span></span>
<div style="width:100%"></div>
<span class="matome-sync-chip matome-sync-chip--cloud">#{icon.("cloud_done", "matome-sync-chip__icon")}<span>Cloud</span></span>
<span class="matome-sync-chip matome-sync-chip--syncing">#{icon.("cloud_sync", "matome-sync-chip__icon")}<span>Syncing</span></span>
<span class="matome-sync-chip matome-sync-chip--on-device">#{icon.("cloud_off", "matome-sync-chip__icon")}<span>On device</span></span>
""")
```

## Relation chips — matome / space / role / file type

```elixir
stage.(css, """
<span class="matome-chip matome-chip--matome">#{icon.("workspaces", "")}<span class="matome-chip__label">Client X — weekly sync</span></span>
<span class="matome-chip matome-chip--matome matome-chip--empty">#{icon.("inbox", "")}<span class="matome-chip__label">Unfiled</span></span>
<span class="matome-chip matome-chip--space">#{icon.("folder", "")}<span class="matome-chip__label">Marketing</span></span>
<span class="matome-chip matome-chip--space matome-chip--empty">#{icon.("inbox", "")}<span class="matome-chip__label">Inbox</span></span>
<div style="width:100%"></div>
<span class="matome-role-chip matome-role-chip--organizer">Organizer</span>
<span class="matome-role-chip matome-role-chip--speaker">Speaker</span>
<span class="matome-role-chip matome-role-chip--attendee">Attendee</span>
<div style="width:100%"></div>
<div style="width:320px"><div class="matome-file-chip">
  <span class="matome-file-chip__icon">#{icon.("file", "")}</span>
  <div class="matome-file-chip__body">
    <div class="matome-file-chip__name">Q3 roadmap.pdf</div>
    <div class="matome-file-chip__size">2.4 MB</div>
  </div>
  <div class="matome-file-chip__open">
    <button class="matome-btn matome-btn--text" disabled>#{icon.("open", "")}<span>Open</span></button>
    <span class="matome-file-chip__soon">soon</span>
  </div>
</div></div>
""")
```

## Panel atoms — section / row / add row

```elixir
stage.(css, """
<div style="width:340px">
  <section class="matome-panel-section">
    <div class="matome-panel-section__head">
      <span class="matome-panel-section__label">Items · 2</span>
      <button class="matome-panel-section__action">Edit</button>
    </div>
    <div class="matome-panel-section__body">
      <div class="matome-panel-row">
        <span class="matome-panel-row__icon">#{icon.("file", "")}</span>
        <div class="matome-panel-row__body">
          <div class="matome-panel-row__title">Meeting audio</div>
          <div class="matome-panel-row__meta">14:30 · 12:04</div>
        </div>
        <span class="matome-sync-chip matome-sync-chip--cloud">#{icon.("cloud_done", "matome-sync-chip__icon")}<span>Cloud</span></span>
      </div>
      <div style="height:var(--matome-space-xs)"></div>
      <button class="matome-panel-add">#{icon.("add", "matome-panel-add__icon")}<span>Add item</span></button>
    </div>
    <hr class="matome-panel-section__divider">
  </section>
</div>
""")
```
